        },
        {
            "+content": "Noi Garené is hailed as the greatest wizard in the Kingdom of Ethria, so when the Demon Lord's vessel turns out to be an orphaned child. She names the young boy Kaldia, and the days fly by as she teaches him magic, cares for him, and soothes his wounded heart. Meanwhile, Noi tirelessly searches for a way to prevent the Demon Lord's emergence. When the fateful day finally arrives, she sacrifices her life to save her dear apprentice. The last thing she expected was to open her eyes a hundred years later and find a man who looks startingly like Kaldia proposing to her the moment she wakes up. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga light novel)</em>",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
        },
